WEBVTT

00:13:55.080 --> 00:14:01.136
and they do so either sometimes
undermining or promoting the common good.

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:05.136
But it is the responsibility
of governments

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:08.376
to protect and promote the common good.

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:11.096
And we should insist

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:13.520
that they fight to do so.

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:17.296
This is because governments

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:18.720
are the guardians

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:20.800
of public health;

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:24.656
governments are the guardians

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:26.536
of the environment;

00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:28.376
and it is governments

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:29.696
that are guardians

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:35.080
of these essential parts
of our common good.